Q.E.D.

That completes the proof of the measure theorem for EV-COND, EV-CASE-BRANCHES
and EVL.  Thus, we admit these functions under the principle of definition.
We could deduce no constraints on the type of any of the functions
in the clique.  However, in normalizing the definitions we used primitive
type reasoning.

